      "writtenOn": "2022-10-28T15:04:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How many volatile images we expect per Recording? I wonder if we\u0027d be better off using a Hash that just returned 1 always. Or just using a std::vector and manually checking for duplications on insertion.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 39,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 39,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "84b5de862bf9f9927eb0e53f8af31a27a2129dcc",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b70cc85b_bcec72e6",
        "filename": "include/gpu/graphite/Recording.h",
        "patchSetId": 24
      },
