      "writtenOn": "2022-11-01T15:14:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In an offline discussion we resolved to keep the map since the hash function shouldn\u0027t be invoked many times to the volatile images. Additionally, if we add a container for non-volatile images that are fulfilled at insertion time we will probably want to use a map for them. Having both be maps will make things simpler.",
      "parentUuid": "1266bcee_89f330dd",
